Z||000000||1FST2M6||02-28-2001||09:29 AM||||well last weekend was a Dyno day sponcered by the Ga. Cobra Only club. everyone was pushing 240-270 at the wheels. one guy with "all the bolt ons" and no mufflers laid down 303hp. I've got an MPGs video of it if any ones interested. i also have a mustang/miata -MGW- parts manufacturers Viper that came with the Mustang Club on the dyno.. it had 1110 miles on it! laid down 407hp and 453lbft. but that "nearly as straon gas his red one" and even more impressive.. but i didn't get a movie of it.. was a friends Civic (Stevie Neeley) it's a SOHC 1.6, running 14psi S/C with CARBON FIBER impellers and a 60shot of nitrous laying down 290hp! pics to follow... <P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg"> ||||reg||1
