Z||000002||stimpy||02-28-2001||10:54 AM||||Speaking of cruel Civics, I was driving home from work last night when I drove up beside a fairly mild looking EX coupe. Had the clear taillights and 17" rims, couple of small decals on the door. No big wing, no combat kit. I pulled up beside, gave it a couple taps on the throttle and it was on! This Honda opened it up and sounded just like Satan's lawnmower and left me like I was a gramma in a Crown Vic! <BR>  After he totally schooled me, he let me catch up and I gave him the upturned thumb and a wave. I felt deflated though, but fortune was on my side, cuz at the bottom of the offramp was a first generation MR2. hehe. I shredded him. Of course only up to 45, cuz it was surface street, but it did restore some manhood.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
