Z||000009||1FST2M6||02-28-2001||01:41 PM||||list of toys you see...<P>Black 90 Civic Si - T4 turbo and spearco intercooler, B16A5 (DOHC) V-spec. (350hp at the wheels)<P>Red/gold 240 Turbo Tom set up with TD05-20G, wide body kit, cage an 2 Sparco carbon fiber seats (310hp)<P>Yellow 91 MR2 Turbo, T04e, custom exhaust, Wings west body kit (340+hp)<P>Black mustang on dyno "all teh bolt ons and still slow (303hp)<P>Viper - uum heh.. had lots of drool on it but stock otherwise (400+hp)<P>Mustang on lift - Bassani Xpipe being installed, ad borla muffler kit, 4:10 rear gear (280hp)<P>Red Eclipse - 420hp too much to list <P>-----<P>next pic<BR>Chromilliusoin Civic Custom Super charger, nitrous, ACT clutch and loads of Stereo crap (works for Hi-Fi Buys) (290hp)<P>RX7 on the lift 330hp single turbo conversion to T04e super 60, 1 seat and a daily driver<P>Red Integra with hood up... S/C 10psi, head work, Auto to 5spd conversion, 13.6-1/4 (230hp) ||||reg||1
Z||000010||1FST2M6||02-28-2001||01:55 PM||||Donald,<BR>Ed wanted to Run your car this weekend but he's double booked.. we've got Porsche Dyno Day and 2 Race cars that have already paid for a few hours of tuning time.. so far (14 cars to run and 9 hours to do it.. uum I'll be there sunday too probly) swing by if your bored... It's always fun to watch a 944 turn the roller to 350+hp with A/C and 120,000 miles! is there any day during the week you could make it over there or maybe after work? I'll be down Putting a TV, Play station, DVD, VCP and sub system in a customers Turbo Civic next week after work.. it'll be there saturday if you wanna see it! DAMN expensive! ||||reg||1
Z||000011||Predator||02-28-2001||02:13 PM||||That sounds like fun. I will see what's going on with the family Saturday and let you know. Just let me know when Ed has time, and I will bring the car over. I don't think I will pull big numbers, but it will be interesting to see what the car has got. Thanks<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
Z||000012||1FST2M6||02-28-2001||02:22 PM||||you can leave your car there and take mine on saturday if ya want. Not as fast or as strong as yours.. but fun to look at..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> We've got other cars i can drive.  so he can Dyno yours and do whatever he needs when ever. Oh my cars pretty loud now though... had a tiny cat on it last time you saw it.. has 2.5" now... made a huge difference! but wakes the neighbors... OOPS..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>--- we'll start a bet like we did for BBBAD GTs V8 run.. when we set a date to run your car.. there is a standing Coke bet.. who ever gets the closest has to go to the fridge and get the other a frosty beverage... heh... it's alooong walk in the shop from the dyno to the back offices!<P>OOH remember that Blue turbo civic with Red Wheels i showed ya that wipped out his sleeve... well that was #1.. he killed #3 also and JE won't warranty the pistons! and neither will total seal honor thier warranyt. he's not too happy... but has Wiseco now and matching rings a new block and is making more HP with less boost! I'll let ya know what comes of the fight with the Piston company. <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 02-28-2001).]||||reg||1
